# munch-mm-diag variant B: MGLRU compiled out entirely (K1 A/B).
#
# Merge AFTER the base diag fragment:
#   make O=out vendor/munch_defconfig munch-mm-diag.config munch-mm-diag-nomglru.config
#
# Variant A (base fragment) carries MGLRU compiled in and runtime-toggled
# via /sys/kernel/mm/lru_gen/enabled; this variant removes every MGLRU
# code path at compile time so a PAGEOUT reproduction cannot touch any
# lru_gen code even indirectly (look_around from rmap, gen accounting).
# CONFIG_LRU_GEN_STATS is dropped implicitly with its parent.
# CONFIG_LRU_GEN is not set
